ttps://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"98f5adf6c40ee7f649d6145b2b5dc3091ca6a717","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-platform-tests/wpt/commits/98f5adf6c40ee7f649d6145b2b5dc3091ca6a717","html_url":"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/98f5adf6c40ee7f649d6145b2b5dc3091ca6a717"}]},{"sha":"064460eb79aa03c69856ee9192b3adc9fbedfdf6","node_id":"C_kwDOADc1VdoAKDA2NDQ2MGViNzlhYTAzYzY5ODU2ZWU5MTkyYjNhZGM5ZmJlZGZkZjY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Munira Tursunova","email":"moonira@google.com","date":"2025-08-26T13:19:48Z"},"committer":{"name":"Blink WPT Bot","email":"blink-w3c-test-autoroller@chromium.org","date":"2025-08-26T13:43:54Z"},"message":"Use fallback in attr() for outer cycles\n\nUse fallback value for outer cycles in attr, for example:\n\ndata-foo=attr(data-foo type(<length>), 3px);\n--x: attr(data-foo type(<length>), 11px);\n\n--x should fallback to `11px`.\n\nIf current property is in the cycle, we don't use fallback, i.e.:\n\ndata-foo=var(--x, 3px);\n--x: attr(data-foo type(<length>), 11px);\n\nhere --x is iacvt.\n\nMore info in tests to this CL.\n\nFixed: 440287244\nChange-Id: I954bf8019db176f6feb598a18972499136f26089\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/6880490\nReviewed-by: Anders Hartvoll Ruud <andruud@chromium.org>\nCommit-Queue: Munira Tursunova <moonira@google.com>\nCr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1506444}","tree":{"sha":"a0b13e1d22403c20b6031939fcac56afd905aa75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-platform-tests/wpt/git/trees/a0b13e1d22403c20b6031939fcac56afd905aa75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web-platform-tests/wpt/git/commits/064460eb79aa03c69856ee9192b3adc9fbedfdf6","comment_count":0,"verification":